# Keep build context small — only the site itself is needed in the image.
.git
.idea
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker/*
!docker/nginx-default.conf
!docker/media-entrypoint.sh
!docker/ssl
# `media/` is NOT baked into the image any more — the container's
# entrypoint downloads/extracts it on first start (see README
# "Media self-hosting"). Locally, media/ may be a symlink to an
# external drive; Docker does not follow symlinks out of the build
# context, which is fine since nothing copies it.
